  m_text: "Dr. A. Vance\r\nPatient: David Leatherhoff\r\nMedication: Remedy (Tablets,
    50 mg)\r\nQuantity: 30 tablets\r\nDirections for Use (Safety Label):\r\n\u2022
    Rx: Take 1 tablet PO (per os / orally) prn (pro re nata / as needed, for acute
    anxiety or hallucinations).\r\n\u2022 Caution: Do not exceed 3 tablets in 24
    hours. Causes severe dependency, blurred vision, euphoria, and temporary loss
    of touch with reality. In case of moving shadows, discontinue use and contact
    the attending specialist immediately.\r\n\u2022 Serial Number / Pharmacy: Silent
    Creek Hospital Pharmacy #402\r\n\u2022 Date Issued: 10/14/2004 | Refills: 0"
